referredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="f-721">1</ix:nonFraction> par value preferred stock, none of which was issued or outstanding as of January&#160;3, 2026 or December&#160;28, 2024. The Company has designated <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="c-94" decimals="0" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="f-722">150,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of preferred stock as Series A junior participating preferred stock and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="c-95" decimals="0" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="f-723">500,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of preferred stock as Series B junior participating preferred stock for possible future issuance.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company repurchased $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-53" decimals="-5" name="www:PurchaseofCommonStockforTreasury" scale="6" id="f-724">14.5</ix:nonFraction> million of Company common stock in fiscal year 2025 under stock repurchase plans and did not repurchase Company common stock in fiscal years 2024 or 2023. In addition to the stock repurchase program activity, the Company acquired $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-1" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:PaymentsRelatedToTaxWithholdingForShareBasedCompensation" scale="6" id="f-725">10.7</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-4" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:PaymentsRelatedToTaxWithholdingForShareBasedCompensation" scale="6" id="f-726">2.6</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-5" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:PaymentsRelatedToTaxWithholdingForShareBasedCompensation" scale="6" id="f-727">5.8</ix:nonFraction> million of Company common stock in fiscal years 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively, in connection with employee transactions related to stock incentive plans.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On March 7, 2024, the Company's Board of Directors approved a common stock repurchase program that authorized the repurchase of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-6" decimals="-6" name="srt:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount1" scale="6" id="f-728">150.0</ix:nonFraction> million of common stock over a three-year period.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:42.75pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">49</span></div></div></div><div id="i74ade219fc2e4863a4e79399edbb1c9b_112"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:42.75pt;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:12pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">4.</span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:GoodwillAndIntangibleAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="f-729" continuedAt="f-729-1" escape="true"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%;padding-left:10.5pt">GOODWILL AND OTHER INTANGIBLE ASSETS</span></ix:nonNumeric></div><ix:continuation id="f-729-1" continuedAt="f-729-2"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfGoodwillTextBlock" id="f-730" escape="true"><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The changes in the carrying amount of goodwill are as follows:</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:5pt"><table style="b